<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>登录 · SEO GEO</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/app.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/p10.css">
</head>
<body class="auth-login-page">
  <main class="auth-login-shell" data-ui="login-page">
    <section class="auth-login-marketing" data-ui="login-marketing" aria-labelledby="login-product-title">
      <div class="auth-login-brand" aria-label="SEO GEO">
        <span class="auth-login-brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">SG</span>
        <span>SEO GEO</span>
      </div>

      <div class="auth-login-message">
        <p class="auth-login-eyebrow">SEO · GEO INTELLIGENCE</p>
        <h1 id="login-product-title">让搜索事实与 AI 可见性<br>进入同一个工作台</h1>
        <p class="auth-login-lead">从项目事实、SEO 审计到 GEO 可见性与受控优化，所有界面只呈现系统已经持久化的数据。</p>

        <ul class="auth-login-benefits" aria-label="平台能力">
          <li><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><strong>多项目事实视图</strong><small>统一查看项目状态与已有采集结果</small></li>
          <li><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><strong>SEO 与 GEO 统一工作台</strong><small>未知数据保持未知，不用虚拟数字补齐界面</small></li>
          <li><span aria-hidden="true">✓</span><strong>受控优化与人工审批边界</strong><small>保留既有权限、审批与发布安全约束</small></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <p class="auth-login-trust">真实数据优先 · 未采集值不会被当作 0</p>
    </section>

    <section class="auth-login-form-side" aria-label="账户登录">
      <div class="auth-login-card" data-ui="login-card">
        <div class="auth-login-card-heading">
          <p class="auth-login-eyebrow">欢迎回来</p>
          <h2>登录 SEO GEO</h2>
          <p>使用已有账户进入工作台。</p>
        </div>

        <form method="post" action="/auth/login" autocomplete="on" class="auth-login-form">
          <input type="hidden" name="returnPath" value="<%= returnPath %>">

          <label class="auth-login-field">
            <span>邮箱</span>
            <input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="username" inputmode="email" required placeholder="name@example.com">
          </label>

          <label class="auth-login-field">
            <span>密码</span>
            <input type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required placeholder="输入密码">
          </label>

          <button type="submit" class="auth-login-submit">登录</button>
        </form>

        <p class="auth-login-footnote">账户与访问权限由系统管理员配置。</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
